Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.12.56-rt76 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.12.56 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.12-rt
  Head SHA1: e67980602819ab82af31d54d83ac4575fe0af6f0


Or to build 3.12.56-rt76 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.12.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.12.56.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.12/patch-3.12.56-rt76.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

